# CREDITS — The Moving Sign

A 10-second ASCII / CRT Terminal film, made entirely in code.

## Picture
80-column character grid, amber P3 phosphor, scanlines, bloom and afterglow
(`film.js`). No image or video sources.

## Type
VT323 — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (`fonts/OFL-VT323.txt`).

## Sound
Original analog-style hum, pad, relay beeps and key clicks, synthesised with
numpy and the library's `core/audio/sfx.py`. No samples.
